{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#934","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#934","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#934\",\"parent_revision\":\"b1dc95071fc76b426569396e929707a6deff52e61c784558cbbabcc7d749a601\",\"root_revision\":\"b1dc95071fc76b426569396e929707a6deff52e61c784558cbbabcc7d749a601\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nCreate the /groom-milestone skill for the development-harness plugin. The skill batch-grooms milestone items, assesses scope gaps, analyzes cross-item dependencies via analyze_impact_radius_conflicts(), builds conflict groups, assigns items to execution waves, and writes a dispatch plan YAML via dispatch_schema. Design doc at .claude/reports/milestone-orchestration-design-20260320.md defines the 10-step workflow with Mermaid diagrams. All tooling dependencies are implemented: dispatch_schema (models, reader, writer, validator), github_branches (integration branch CRUD), quality gates runner, and conflict analysis.\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**RT-ICA**: Create /groom-milestone skill \u2014 APPROVED\\n\\nAll conditions AVAILABLE. Design doc has full workflow. All tooling dependencies implemented (dispatch_schema, github_branches, quality gates, conflict analysis). Skill creation patterns known.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **create /groom-milestone skill** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Milestone orchestration design \u2014 .claude/reports/milestone-orchestration-design-20260320.md\\n- **Priority**: P0\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-21\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-03-22)\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n\\n- **dispatch_create_plan MCP tool needed** (from #1013 analysis): The groom-milestone skill produces a dispatch plan (conflict groups, wave assignments, quality gates) but no MCP tool exists to persist it. Four dispatch *execution* tools exist (dispatch_wave_start, dispatch_item_status, dispatch_wave_status, dispatch_spawn) but no dispatch plan *creation* tool. The `write_dispatch_plan(plan: DispatchPlan, path: Path)` Python function exists in `dispatch_schema/writers/yaml_writer.py` \u2014 needs an MCP wrapper in `backlog_core/dispatch.py`. The orchestrator must never write YAML directly or call Python functions \u2014 all persistence goes through MCP tools.\\n\",\"digest\":\"1c243504ef8ec50e1b5a38e036fb4f2ba86baead567a5944d8b0449c342269be\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWXhkw\"}"}